# API Contracts

- Routers stay thin; Pydantic models own request/response shapes.
- Any new endpoint → update `frontend/src/lib/api.ts` types + callers in the same change.
- Write paths require `X-API-Key`; document demo key only as `intellens-demo`.
- Matching key remains `(company_id, period, metric)`.
- Do not invent endpoints in the UI without a backend route (or explicit stub + flag).
- Map lives in `docs/kb/05-api-map.md` — update it when routes change.
